    {"ops": [{"kind": "link", "disk": "t1", "path": "F/a.mkv", "path2": "G/a.mkv"}], "path": "F/a.mkv", "source": {"kind": "catalog", "paths": ["F/a.mkv"]}, "note": "and the name it was made from stays as it was: each name is a file of its own"},
